"""Session 0 (Leadership Edition). The AI landscape for leaders.

The introduction: the promise and who the course is for; AI as a family in plain words; a model learns from examples like a new employee;
the four jobs AI does (Sessions 1 to 10); good and bad at; the industry tour and three cases; adoption reality; a recorded demonstration
(rule, trained model, chatbot on the Nile Valley Foods customer messages); shadow AI and your people; the three threads and the route;
the hands-on (choose your industry, first portfolio entries); a decision.

Cases (research/*.md): PUB-01, BNK-02, TEL-03, AGR-01, MFG-04, HLT-01, ADO-01, ADO-02, ADO-05; added PPL-11 and PPL-12 (shadow AI).
Recorded runs: demo_runs/s02/run_output.txt and RUN_RECORD_2026-11-11.md (40 messages; scikit-learn 1.9.1; 5 and 11 November 2026);
demo_runs/s12_rule_vs_ai.md and the Executive Edition file '04 Facilitator Materials/Twelve-Message AI Demonstration Results (4 Nov 2026).md'
(rule 7 of 12; Claude, three fresh sessions, 9 of 12 exact, 11 of 12 acceptable). Nile Valley Foods is fictional. No maths.
"""

